          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua wakashila Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, tshioshelu mu mukuna wa Ebala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bu muakambila Mose, muntu wa Yehowa, Bena Isalele, bu muakafundabo mu mukanda wa mikenji ya Mose; bakasa tshioshelu ne mabue adibo kabayi banze kusonga ne biamu; bakafidilahu milambu ya kuosha kudi Yehowa ne milambu ya kuvuisha nʼai ditalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakafunda ha mabue â mikenji ya Mose, yakafundeye ku mpala kua Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Isalele bonso ne bakulu babo ne tuhita ne balumbuluishi babo bakimana ku luseke ne luseke lua mushete ku mpala kua bakuidi, Bena Lewi, bakadi batuala mushete wa tshihungidi tshia mei a Yehowa; benyi kabidi bakimana bu bantu baledibue ba munkatshi muabo; tshituha tshiabo ku mukuna wa Gelezima ne tshituha tshikuabo ku mukuna wa Ebala; bu muakadianjila Mose, muntu wa Yehowa, kubambila, bua kuvudishila Bena Isalele masanka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku nyima wakababadila mei onso a mikenji, ne masanka ne milau, bu muakadi malu onso mafunda mu mukanda wa mikenji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua kakashiya dî dimue dia mei onso akamba Mose; yeye wakâbadila tshisumbu tshijima tshia Bena Isalele ne bakashi ne bana bakese ne benyi bakadi munkatshi muabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.35"
            ]
          }
        }
